# ── Security hardening ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Added 2026-09-14: this file didn't exist before, so data/users.json
# and data/sessions.json (usernames, bcrypt password hashes, and live
# per-user session tokens) were publicly downloadable by anyone who
# knew the URL. Everything below blocks direct access to files that
# should only ever be read server-side by PHP, or shouldn't be in a
# web-servable directory at all. It does NOT touch the public data
# files the site itself fetches client-side (data/news.json,
# data/spiele.json, data/uzwil4.json, data/live_squad.json) — those
# stay exactly as accessible as before.

<Files "users.json">
    Require all denied
</Files>
<Files "sessions.json">
    Require all denied
</Files>
<Files "fan_devices.json">
    Require all denied
</Files>
# Retired web admin (replaced by the admin iOS app) - kept, not reachable.
<Files "admin.html">
    Require all denied
</Files>
<Files ".env">
    Require all denied
</Files>
<FilesMatch "\.p8$">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>
<Files "ios.txt">
    Require all denied
</Files>
<FilesMatch "\.zip$">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>

# No browsing folder contents anywhere on this site.
Options -Indexes

# Block any .git metadata that ends up inside the web root.
RedirectMatch 404 ^/\.git/

# ── Project layout (2026-09) ────────────────────────────────────────
# All PHP now lives in /api. The public URLs that the website admin page
# and the iOS/Android apps already call (e.g. /save-news.php) are kept
# working by rewriting them to /api/<name>.php. Do NOT add a new endpoint
# only in /api without also adding it to this list if apps need the old
# root-style URL. apns.php / auth-lib.php are libraries and stay unreachable.
RewriteEngine On
RewriteRule ^(save-news|delete-news|save-goal|delete-goal|save-squad|set-live|reset-match|login|change-password|create-user|mark-welcome-seen|register-device|session-status|set-user-blocked|register-fan-device)\.php$ api/$1.php [L]

# Internal docs / local tooling must never be served.
RedirectMatch 404 ^/(docs|local-table-updater)/
